  "_comment": "AHSync's Gathering catalog (SPEC §3.4E.1), version 1, 2026-10-21: a Classic-era (1.12) list of stackable, directly farmable trade goods (herbs, ores and node stones, leathers, hides and scales, fish, cloth, elemental and cooking drops). key = the Classic item id, which is AHF's key for an unsuffixed item. skill = the lowest gather skill of the source (the node, or the beast for skinning). Fishing is listed at skill 1: Classic lets you fish anywhere, but a zone's catch needs more skill there, which V1 does not model. Gems from mining nodes, grey vendor trash (fangs, claws) and raid-only materials are left out. Rows with a 'note' carry an uncertain skill or a secondary source. FOREVER CAVEAT: WoW: Forever customises items and professions, so this list may be incomplete or wrong for its content; correct it as differences are found (SPEC §6).",
